{
 "id": "4b39f262-b6ba-475b-ac57-7c318c35efde",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Starting on a Deserted Island"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "zh": "从荒岛开始灭妖斩神"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Lin Tian is stranded on a mysterious island, only to discover it’s filled with goddesses from countless worlds—and deadly foes like demon kings and evil gods. By binding with powerful beings like Yuki-Onna, he gains ice powers; from Shiranui, he commands fire; and with Medusa, he unlocks petrifying might. Wielding countless divine artifacts and abilities, Lin Tian slays demon kings, cuts down evil gods, and rises as the island’s supreme ruler—founding a paradise for gods and legends alike!",
   "zh": "林天流落神秘荒岛，发现岛上还有无数来自诸天万界的女神，以及各路妖王、邪神。绑定雪女，获得冰雪能力；绑定不知火，获得火焰能力；绑定美杜莎……林天觉醒无数强大力量，手持无数神兵法宝，杀妖王、斩邪神，称霸荒岛，建立众神乐园。"
  },
